ration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4.1 业务背景&#8204;</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l9 level2 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-4.2.4累积快照事实表-‌4.2设计流程‌" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;4.2 设计流程&#8204;</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l9 level2 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-4.2.4累积快照事实表-4.3数据处理流程" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4.3 数据处理流程</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-4.2.4累积快照事实表-5.企业案例" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >5.企业案例</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l9 level2 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-4.2.4累积快照事实表-方法1：全量存储，一个df表" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >方法</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1：全量存储，一个df表</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l9 level2 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-4.2.4累积快照事实表-方法2：最近n天的df表+历史数据的归档di表" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >方法</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2：最近n天的df表 + 历史数据的归档di表</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.定义</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >累积快照事实表一般用来跟踪实体的一系列过程的进展情况，统计不同业务过程之间的时间间隔，并在确定生命周期内不断更新业务过程的事实。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >累积快照事实表中一般会包括多个业务过程日期，适用于具有较明确起止时间的短生命周期</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >（数据消亡时间较短且固定，比如询盘，每天更新最近</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >180d内发送的询盘状态）的实体，但是不同业务过程的时间跨度一般是不确定且不断变化的（询盘并不确定多久会被回复）。即对于累积快照事实表中的管道或工作流过程（例如，询盘回复、履行订单或索赔过程），一般具有定义的开始点，标准中间过程，定义的结束点，但是变化的时间跨度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >累积快照事实表的行，汇总了发生在过程开始和结束之间，可预测步骤内的度量事件。</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >通常，表中的关键步骤都包含对应的日期外键。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >举例</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >交易全流程表，一般会包含订单创建、支付、确认收货等业务过程，根据不同业务，限制订单在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >n天的生命周期内必须完成，其中可能发生的创建、支付、退款等业务过程，是标准可枚举的，但是时间间隔不确定，表内通常会包含创建、支付、退款等关键步骤对应的时间字段；度量包括支付金额、退款金额等。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >EDM运营全流程表，一般会包含发送、打开、点击等业务过程，根据不同场景，限制邮件在n天内生命周期必须完成，超过该生命周期的打开、点击等视为无效的话，其中可能发生的送达、打开、点击等业务过程，是标准可枚举的，但是时间间隔不确定，表内通常会包含送达、打开、点击等关键步骤对应的时间字段（最近一次或者最晚一次）；度量包括打开次数、点击次数等。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >物理表设计：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >假设累积快照事实表所描述的多个时间过程，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数据消亡</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >/稳定时间为n天，即以n天作为一块业务从产生到消亡的最大时间间隔</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >（能够覆盖</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >99%以上场景）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >核心目的：在考虑业务逻辑、保证数据易用性的基础上，兼顾数据的计算存储成本以及开发开发的难易程度</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >. </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >另外注意一点</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >, </font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"19"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >是累积快照事实表而不是累计快照事实表</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.核心特点&#8204;</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;跟踪业务流程全生命周期&#8204;：记录业务实体（如订单）从创建到终结的所有关键事件时间点。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;多日期字段&#8204;：每个关键步骤对应一个时间戳（如创建、支付、发货、完成时间）。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;状态指标更新&#8204;：随着流程推进，动态更新状态字段和累积指标（如退款金额）。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;稀疏性低&#8204;：每个实体（如订单）仅存一行记录，随时间推移更新字段。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3. 设计示例</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >针对交易，设计了交易下单</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >/支付/确认收货事务型事实表，用于统计下单OR支付OR确认收货的子订单数、GMV等。但仍然有很多需求，此事务型事实表很难满足</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >比如统计买家下单到支付的时长、买家支付到卖家发货的时长、买家从下单到确认收货的时长等。如果使用事务型事实表统计，逻辑复杂且性能很差。</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >对于类似研究事件之间时间间隔的需求，采用累积快照事实表可以很好的解决。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.1 设计过程 </font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >对于累积快照事实表，建模过程和事务型事实表相同，适用维度建模的步骤。下面详述一下交易累积快照事实表的设计过程，并对比事务型事实表的设计差异。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第一步，选择业务过程。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.1事实表基础章节讲解了交易订单的流转过程，主要有如下四个业务过程：买家下单、买家支付、卖家发货、买家确认收货。对于此4个业务过程，在事务型统计中只关注下单、支付和确认收货三个业务过程。而在统计事件时间间隔的需求中，卖家发货也是关键环节。所以针对交易累积快照事实表，我们选择此四个业务过程。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第二步，确定粒度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在事务型事实表中提到，对于交易，业务需求一般是从子订单粒度进行统计分析，所以选择子订单粒度。交易事务型事实表的粒度也是子订单，但通常对于子订单的每个事件都会记录一行；而对于累积快照表，子订单在此表中只有一行记录，事件发生时，对此记录进行更新。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo7;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第三步，确定维度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >同事务型事实表相同，维度主要有买家、卖家、店铺、商品、类目、发货地区、收货地区等。四个业务过程对应的时间字段，格式为日期</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >+时间，分别为下单时间、支付时间、发货时间、确认收货时间，会对应日期维度表，下图中未标示。实际使用时会使用视图或SQL别名的方式表示四个日期角色维度。类似于发货地区维度和收货地区维度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >交易订单表中，存在很多订单相关的属性，如订单的类型、子类型、支付状态、物流状态、</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >attributes、options等。对于类似的属性字段，无法归属到已有的商品等维度中，所以新建杂项维度存放。在数据仓库建模理论中，杂项维度一般无自然键，一般是可枚举值的组合，对于每个组合生成一个代理键。但实际建模中，存在很多不可枚举值，且对于每个订单都不相同，如订单的attributes和options属性。所以实际中杂项维度设计时，也可以直接使用自然键标示具体的维度值，如下图中所示的子订单维度和父订单维度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"593"  height=3D"678"  src=3D"~tmp{80ddc821-2453-4e7c-b272-17e537329edc}2820904.files/~tmp{80ddc821-2453-4e7c-b272-17e537329edc}28209042982.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.2 累积快照事实表特点</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1）</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"19"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数据不断更新</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >事务型事实表记录事务发生时的状态，对于表中的记录不再更新；而</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >累积快照事实表则对表记录中的字段定期更新</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。以交易为例，下表通过实例展示了事务型事实表的情况，对于</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >order1订单，2024-11-12支付之后，产生新的支付记录，2024-11-11的数据不会更新。截止2024-11-13日，买家确认收货之后，共产生3条记录。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2024-11-11下单：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><table class=3DMsoNormalTable  border=3D1  cellspacing=3D0  style=3D"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:3.3000pt;border:none;=20mso-border-left-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;mso-border-insideh:0.7500pt outset windowtext;mso-border-insidev:0.7500pt outset windowtext;=20mso-padding-alt:0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt ;" ><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >日期</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt soli